  "description": "A system of institutionalized racial segregation and discrimination in South Africa that was enforced by the National Party government from 1948 until the early 1990s. The meme's false claim of 'white genocide' is often used by those who wish to revive or justify apartheid-era ideologies, despite the fact that apartheid was dismantled and replaced by a democratic, multiracial government.",
